/v1/","context":{"app_id":4932590,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4932590-1846018067940034","game_id":"steam-4932590","kind":"announcement","title":"Shop Bulletin 4 - From the Desk of Bob","summary":"From the desk of BOB - Owner of 8bit Salvage and a hairless Chia pet. So, I just heard that our shop will be part of Steam's Next Fest in 7 days. Randy told me that this is a \"big deal\", that I should ask everyone to \"wishlist us\", and to \"quit putting everything in quotes\". Oh...We have a few improvements for the demo that I wanted to share. Yup! No note cards this time, at least none that I'm going to read. Sometimes you have to trust that just being yourself is enough. Well, that's half the b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:18:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940034","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932590-1844115010500672","game_id":"steam-4932590","kind":"announcement","title":"Shop Bulletin 3 — From the Desk of Bob","summary":"From the desk of BOB - Owner of 8bit Salvage and a slightly used set of Emeril knives.Ok, everyone. This time Randy gave me a lot of note cards. He says they're in order, but I'm not sure if that was before or after I dropped them.Randy's RunesAnyways, let's start with Randy's new toy. I know there were at least 3 cards in here about it.See, Randy found some runes in this broken machine from some abandoned storage unit. I'm thinking people hoard the weirdest things, but Randy said that these cou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T08:04:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500672","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932590-1841579228665306","game_id":"steam-4932590","kind":"announcement","title":"Shop Bulletin 2 — From the Desk of Bob","summary":"From the desk of BOB - Owner of 8bit Salvage and a genuine moon rock. Ok. This time I'll be reading from some note cards Randy gave me, so if anything doesn't make sense, just put your complaint in the box. Randy improved MY goo formula even more! Goo can now spread across the entire sprite. This did remove the old acid peeling, but we... ok, Randy... improved the normal auto-peel formula to make up for it. Also, my allergies seemed to have improved. The roller launchers spin slower now. Nobody ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T12:07:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665306","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932590-1840944183774708","game_id":"steam-4932590","kind":"announcement","title":"Shop Bulletin — From the Desk of Bob","summary":"From the desk of BOB — Owner of 8bit Salvage and various collectible mugs Big week at the shop. I've completed speech therapy. They say I'm still tone-deaf, but that's just a matter of practice. You may now interrupt me while I'm talking. Randy installed a button. I've chosen not to take it personally. The big speeches stay uninterruptible — those are my art. Randy changed the sprite solution. The pixels sound different coming off now. Riper, if you ask me. The rollers also got a redesign and th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T18:06:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774708","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4932590-1840310314345325","game_id":"steam-4932590","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out — a full \"early years\" story arc, free","summary":"The demo is now live, and it's a full \"early years\" story arc all on its own.8bit Salvage (the company - which is just Bob, Randy, and you) salvages pixels from retired game sprites. You hold a spinning brush over the art, the pixels come off one at a time, and they get sucked up through the hose. Your boss, Bob, walks you through everything, but not really. You'll see!It starts off slow, and as you upgrade your workplace, things go from calm to kinda chaotic - in the best kinda way. About 40 mi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T15:18:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345325","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4932590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4932590":"2026-10-26T05:30:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4932590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5043420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:30:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4932590","app_id":4932590,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a272d2376ff8c76177f92b9dd150d0c